","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1038","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[75,70,72,74,73,83],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"1900","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1006002","armor":"WP1006205","helmet":"WP1021305","horse":"WP1002315"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10128","city":"CS1039","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[75,70,72,74,73,83],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"1900","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1006002","armor":"WP1006205","helmet":"WP1021305","horse":"WP1002315"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"蜀汉末期名将、安南将军、南中都督。其父霍峻为蜀汉名将，早年入宫为太子舍人，陪伴刘禅，忠心耿耿。历任黄门侍郎、安南将军，都督南中，治理有方，深得民心。成都被攻陷后拒降魏国，直至确信刘禅安全后才率部将投降。降晋后，继续被委以镇守南方的重任，仍为南中都督，平定交阯、日南、九真三郡，功封列侯。交趾之战期间去世。","tc":"蜀漢末期名將、安南將軍、南中都督。其父霍峻為蜀漢名將，早年入宮為太子舍人，陪伴劉禪，忠心耿耿。歷任黃門侍郎、安南將軍，都督南中，治理有方，深得民心。成都被攻陷后拒降魏國，直至確信劉禪安全后才率部將投降。降晉后，繼續被委以鎮守南方的重任，仍為南中都督，平定交阯、日南、九真三郡，功封列侯。交趾之戰期間去世。","en":"A famed general of late Shu Han who served as South Off. (defense) and Viceroy of Nanzhong. His father Huo Jun was a renowned general of Shu Han. In his early years, Huo Yi entered the palace as Cadet to the Crown Prince, attending to Liu Shan with steadfast loyalty. He successively served as Attendant and South Off. (defense), and governed Nanzhong as Viceroy with great skill, winning immense popularity. After Chengdu fell, he refused to yield to Wei, only leading his subordinates to surrender once he was certain of Liu Shan's safety. After surrendering to Jin, he was again entrusted with the vital duty of defending the south as Viceroy of Nanzhong, pacifying the three commanderies of Jiaozhi, Rinan, and Jiuzhen, for which he was enfeoffed as a Full Marquis. He passed away during the Jiaozhi campaign.","jp":"蜀漢末期の名将、安南将軍、南中都督。父の霍峻も蜀漢の名将である。若くして宮中に入り太子舎人として劉禅に仕え、忠義を尽くした。黄門侍郎、安南将軍を歴任して南中を都督し、治績を上げて深く民心を得た。成都が陥落した後も魏への降伏を拒み、劉禅の安全を確信して初めて部将を率いて降伏した。晋に降った後も引き続き南方の鎮守という重任を委ねられ、変わらず南中都督として交阯・日南・九真の三郡を平定し、功により列侯に封じられた。交趾の戦いの最中に死去した。","kr":"촉한 말기의 명장이자 안남장군, 남중도독. 부친 곽준은 촉한의 명장이었으며, 일찍이 입궁하여 태자사인이 되어 유선을 모시며 지극한 충성을 다했다. 황문시랑, 안남장군 등을 역임하고 남중을 도독할 때에는 선정을 베풀어 깊이 민심을 얻었다. 성도가 함락된 뒤에도 위나라에 항복하기를 거부하다가, 유선이 안전함을 확인한 뒤에야 부하 장수들을 이끌고 항복했다. 진나라에 항복한 후에도 계속 남방을 진수하는 중책을 맡아 여전히 남중도독으로서 교지, 일남, 구진 3군을 평정하고 그 공으로 열후에 봉해졌다. 교지 전투 도중에 세상을 떠났다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10447","remark":"","surname":"霍","surnameTc":"霍","surnameEn":"Huo","surnameJp":"霍","surnameKr":"곽","surnameOther":"","name":"弋","nameTc":"弋","nameEn":"Yi","nameJp":"弋","nameKr":"익","nameOther":"","word":"绍先","wordTc":"紹先","wordEn":"Shaoxian","wordJp":"紹先","wordKr":"소선","wordOther":"","icon":"霍弋","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"221","city":"CS1038","gender":"0","rule":"75","force":"70","wise":"72","politics":"74","charm":"73","will":"83","ruleTalent":"9","forceTalent":"7","wiseTalent":"7","politicsTalent":"8","charmTalent":"6","willTalent":"10","weaponMaster":"67/22/22/22/22/18/50/53","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"1003502;1004802","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"1001505","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"5300","battleSoulPoint":"4700","debateSoulPoint":"4700","strategy":"1015015","strategy2":"1006401;1003901","professions":"3/2/0/3/3/2/2/0/2/1/0/4/3/3/4/0/2/3/1/1/1/2/2/2","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"7","compatible":"44","loyalty":"0","reputation":"1900","evaluate":"6000","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"207","show":"221","death":"270","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"0","type":"1","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"3","weapon":"WP1006002","armor":"WP1006205","helmet":"WP102130